# Owner UI

Read [apps/web/src/routes/d/DESIGN.md](../../apps/web/src/routes/d/DESIGN.md) before changing owner UI visuals. That file is the source of truth.

- Forced dark native desktop: `#0e0e0e`, 12px system UI, 4% hairlines, no drop shadows, ~28px rows
- Primitives from `@coss` into `apps/web/src/components/ui`. Overlay Functhis tokens. Never `@coss/style` or dump `@coss/ui`
- Signed-in `/_auth`: `AppShell` (frosted sidebar + `app-content-card`). Login / device / consent: `AuthCanvas`, no sidebar
- Import `@/components/ui/*` (including `sonner` until `@coss/toast` exists)
- Do not restyle marketing. Do not fake product nav. Do not add Inter/Geist or a theme toggle
- Add later primitives with `bunx --bun shadcn@latest add @coss/<name>` from `apps/web`, then flatten shadows and convert CLI `function` components to arrows
